      "body": "**Comment from ByteCommander:**\n\nI see and share your concerns. Mainly posting this because the topic came up in chat yesterday and ended up in \"someone write an issue\". \n\nIndeed, tracking the \"online\" status might be too much. Last message could maybe also be determined on demand though, using the search feature with `from:user-tag#1234`, but I am not sure if an API endpoint exists for this, I couldn't find one.",
